OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWinds soon strengthening with a
OL,6,Frisk of gales developing. Many areas
OL,7,Fstaying dry for much of the day with
OL,8,Fjust some outbreaks of rain over
OL,9,FArgyll, which will become more
OL,10,Fwidespread and persistent later in the
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be cloudy in the
OL,14,Fevening and overnight with rain
OL,15,Fspreading southwards and becoming
OL,16,Fheavy at times. Strong winds through
OL,17,Fthe evening but easing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
