OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FRain may be heavy at times
OL,6,Fin the morning as it clears to the
OL,7,Fsouth. Increasingly bright spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping during the afternoon with
OL,9,Fthe odd shower possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,12,Fspells and showers early Friday, then
OL,13,Fdrier with clearer skies later. Mostly
OL,14,Fdry with sunny spells and light winds
OL,15,Fthrough the weekend. Chillier nights
OL,16,Fthan of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
